<view class="camera-container">
  <view class="header-tip">请将脸部对准下方引导线</view>

  <view class="camera-wrapper">
    <camera device-position="{{devicePosition}}" flash="{{flashMode}}" resolution="high" class="live-camera">
      
      <cover-view class="flash-btn" bindtap="toggleFlash">
        <cover-view class="flash-text">{{flashMode === 'torch' ? '💡 补光开' : '⚡ 补光关'}}</cover-view>
      </cover-view>

      <cover-view class="flip-btn" bindtap="switchCamera">
        <cover-view class="flip-text">🔄 翻转</cover-view>
      </cover-view>

      <cover-view class="scan-frame">
        <cover-view class="corner top-left"></cover-view>
        <cover-view class="corner top-right"></cover-view>
        <cover-view class="corner bottom-left"></cover-view>
        <cover-view class="corner bottom-right"></cover-view>
        
        <cover-view class="guide-wrapper">
          <cover-view class="eye-guide-line">
            <cover-view class="guide-text">眼睛请位于此线上方</cover-view>
          </cover-view>
          <cover-view class="mouth-guide-box">
            <cover-view class="guide-text focus-text">请张大嘴巴对准此框</cover-view>
          </cover-view>
        </cover-view>

        <cover-view class="center-line"></cover-view>
        <cover-view class="cross-hair-vertical"></cover-view>
      </cover-view>
    </camera>
  </view>

  <view class="instruction-card">
    <view class="inst-title">💡 获得精准报告的秘诀</view>
    <view class="inst-list">
      <view class="inst-item"><text class="dot"></text>请确保画面光线充足，必要时开启左上角补光（仅后置）</view>
      <view class="inst-item"><text class="dot"></text>尽量张大嘴巴，露出上下完整的牙龈</view>
      <view class="inst-item"><text class="dot"></text>将牙齿完全置于绿色的聚焦框内</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="btn-group">
    <button class="capture-btn" bindtap="takePhotoAndCrop">
      <text class="icon">📸</text> 实时拍摄
    </button>
    <button class="album-btn" bindtap="chooseFromAlbum">
      <text class="icon">🖼️</text> 相册
    </button>
  </view>

  <canvas type="2d" id="cropCanvas" class="offscreen-canvas"></canvas>
</view>